  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.38: Preserve canonical original implementation effort and dates before allocating novel replay contributions within the remaining joint budget. Normalize period and event offsets to UTC while preserving local timezone, DST and exclusive-end behavior. Warn when replay dates or baselines are unavailable. Record privacy-safe provider API, operation, exit/HTTP status and timeout ownership; preserve root request failures and incomplete output without aggregates. Full-range joint totals and category ranges remain conserved; estimator priors and rates are unchanged. EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated; declared allocations do not establish actual workdays or integration labor. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.38/CHANGELOG.md",
